graph TD
    subgraph Client
        U[User with Selfie] -->|POST /api/v1/search/| S[Search API]
        O[Organizer with Photos] -->|POST /api/v1/photos/| P[Upload API]
    end

    subgraph Backend [FastAPI Application]
        P --> DB[SQLModel / PostgreSQL]
        P -->|Background Task| Worker[VisionRAG Worker]
        
        S --> Extract[MLProcessor: extract_features]
        Extract --> Query[VisionRAG: FAISS Query]
        Query --> Result[Match Photo Metadata]
        Result --> Client
    end

    subgraph ML_Engine [Vision RAG Engine]
        Worker --> Detect[Face Detection: HOG]
        Detect --> Enc[Face Encoding: 128D Vector]
        Enc --> Index[FAISS HNSW Index: O log N]
        Index --> Persist[Vector Meta Storage]
    end

    subgraph Monitoring
        Metrics[Prometheus Client]
        Logs[Loguru Structured JSON]
        Tracking[MLflow Experiment Tracking]
    end

    Backend -.-> Monitoring
    ML_Engine -.-> Tracking
